  "question": {
    "text": "Electromagnetic waves travel in a medium with a speed of <math> <mrow> <mtext>2</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup> <mrow> <mtext>10</mtext></mrow> <mn>8</mn> </msup> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mtext>s</mtext> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </msup> <mo>.</mo></mrow> </math> The relative permeability of the medium is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>. Find the relative permittivity."
  },
